# Torpor Orb stops an ability that functions from the graveyard too (CR 603.2): Sword of the Meek's "Whenever a 1/1
# creature you control enters, you may return this card from your graveyard to the battlefield". Bot1 puts the Sword in
# its graveyard with its own Disenchant on turn 1; Bot2's Orb comes down on turn 2; Bot1's Llanowar Elves, a 1/1, enters
# on turn 3 and Bot1 is asked nothing (! Bot1.Accept, after a second pass that would let a trigger resolve), the
# Sword staying in the graveyard. Sword of the Meek's own game,
# where the Elves bring it back, is the control.

